    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107981" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερχρόν-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beyond the usual time</i>
			of life, <i>very old,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Zen.
				6.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>overdue,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFlor.
				86.21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερχρονία, ἡ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερημερία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLips.</u>
				120.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>: but, <i>pay for overtime</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BSA</u>
				27.234
			</span></i> (Sparta, <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>).</div>
